globalThis.Lesson={"manifest":{"id":"s17x-r1-distillation-optimization","sceneId":"r1","methods":["opt"],"title":"常减压操作优化：收率、质量与能耗的边界","version":"1.0.0","updated":"2026-10-24","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"同一原油批次，为什么不能只把炉温调高？先读懂分馏与质量约束，再用实际拟合的代理模型寻找可行操作点。","sections":[{"no":1,"title":"原油怎样被分成不同馏分","html":"<p>原油包含许多沸点不同的烃。加热后进入常压塔，较易挥发的组分向上，较重组分更多留在下部；不同位置取出的馏分还需后续处理，不能简单等同于最终商品油。常压塔底重油进入减压塔，降低压力后可在较低温度汽化，减少过度加热带来的裂化和结焦风险。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"分离依据是沸程；常压塔底重油进入减压塔，降低沸腾所需温度。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"65\" width=\"130\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"95.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">原油 → 加热炉</text><path d=\"M150 88 L220 88\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M214 84L220 88L214 92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"220\" y=\"20\" width=\"110\" height=\"130\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">常压塔</text><path d=\"M330 45 L440 45\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M434 41L440 45L434 49\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"50\">轻馏分：石脑油等</text><path d=\"M330 95 L440 95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M434 91L440 95L434 99\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"100\">中间馏分：煤油、柴油</text><path d=\"M330 135 L440 135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M434 131L440 135L434 139\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"445\" y=\"115\" width=\"130\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"510.0\" y=\"143.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">减压塔</text><path d=\"M575 137 L625 137\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M619 133L625 137L619 141\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"630\" y=\"143\">蜡油、渣油</text></g></svg><figcaption>分离依据是沸程；常压塔底重油进入减压塔，降低沸腾所需温度。</figcaption></figure>"},{"no":2,"title":"看懂三个指标，才知道优化什么","html":"<p>本例把总馏分回收率作为收益指标：每100 kg原料有多少进入目标馏分。单位能耗用GJ/t表示；终馏点用°C表示，是描述该馏分蒸发末端的指标。回收更多重组分可能抬高终馏点，产品质量边界因此会限制收率。教学中固定原油批次，只讨论炉出口温度、回流比、减压塔绝压三个输入。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"加热和回流会改变分离效果，也带来能耗；最优点取决于质量与能耗边界。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><path d=\"M75 20V135H690\" stroke=\"#78918e\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M85 120Q350 30 670 25\" stroke=\"#257f78\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M85 130Q400 125 670 30\" stroke=\"#c28148\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"25\">趋势示意：各指标单独归一化</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"160\">操作强度增加 →</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"63\" fill=\"#257f78\">回收率：提高后趋缓</text><text x=\"410\" y=\"117\" fill=\"#a45e2e\">能耗：逐渐上升</text></g></svg><figcaption>加热和回流会改变分离效果，也带来能耗；最优点取决于质量与能耗边界。</figcaption></figure><table><tr><th>输入</th><th>含义 / 教学范围</th></tr><tr><td>炉出口温度</td><td>350–380°C，提供汽化所需热量</td></tr><tr><td>回流比</td><td>1.4–2.6，塔顶返回液量与采出量之比</td></tr><tr><td>减压塔绝压</td><td>5–11kPa，数值越小真空越深</td></tr></table>"},{"no":3,"title":"代理模型把历史关系变成候选方案","html":"<p>每条训练记录由三个操作量和三个测量结果构成。用温度、回流、压力及二次项拟合三个回归方程，建立便于搜索的代理模型。对当前压力枚举961组炉温与回流比，先剔除预测能耗和终馏点越界的点，再在剩余点里找最高回收率。图上的灰点表示不满足约束；颜色代表预测收率。</p><p>默认点365°C、回流比2.0是固定操作基线。另用训练均值预测测试批次，帮助判断拟合是否真正学到了输入输出关系。48条测试批次只在模型拟合后计算MAE，不参与系数拟合或搜索。</p>"},{"no":4,"title":"数据与专业依据","html":"<p>160个独立工况由公开可读的固定公式生成，112个拟合、48个评价；变化趋势、数值范围和约束限值均为本例教学设定，不对应某一炼厂。优化预测与独立测试误差分别展示，避免把网格最高预测值当成已测量的生产效果。</p><p>专业阅读：<a href=\"https://www.eia.gov/todayinEnergy/detail.php?id=9130\">EIA：减压蒸馏在炼油中的作用</a>；<a href=\"https://www.eia.gov/energyexplained/oil-and-petroleum-products/refining-crude-oil-the-refining-process.php\">EIA：原油加工与馏分分离</a>。图为本例原创概念示意。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","steps":[{"name":"整理独立工况","do":"把炉温、回流、绝压与同批测量结果配对，固定112/48训练测试切分。","effect":"每条记录的输入、结果和单位明确。","trap":"不同原油或取样时段混合会使关联失真。"},{"name":"拟合并检查三个代理","do":"分别拟合回收率、能耗、终馏点的二次回归，用48个独立工况计算误差。","effect":"得到可重复计算的系数和各指标MAE。","trap":"高收率预测并不意味着能耗和质量也合格。"},{"name":"筛选可行域","do":"固定用户选择的绝压，枚举31×31组温度与回流，按两个上限筛选。","effect":"可行与越界候选在二维图上分开。","trap":"若无可行点，应显示空解，不能放宽约束后假装成功。"},{"name":"比较并解释推荐点","do":"在可行点中选最高回收率，与固定操作点并排比较，再检查是否贴近约束。","effect":"得到条件明确的候选方案和基线差异。","trap":"结果只覆盖当前搜索范围；模型误差意味着贴边方案应额外核查。"}],"metrics":{"html":"<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"整理独立工况：每条记录的输入、结果和单位明确。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"55\" width=\"170\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">训练批次</text><path d=\"M185 85 L245 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M239 81L245 85L239 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"245\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"337.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">输入与同批测量</text><path d=\"M430 85 L490 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M484 81L490 85L484 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">留出批次另行评价</text></g></svg><figcaption>整理独立工况：每条记录的输入、结果和单位明确。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"拟合并检查三个代理：得到可重复计算的系数和各指标MAE。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"175\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">温度 / 操作 / 原料</text><path d=\"M200 85 L255 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M249 81L255 85L249 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"55\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"355.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">拟合回归系数</text><path d=\"M455 85 L505 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M499 81L505 85L499 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"505\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"615.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">各输出分别预测</text></g></svg><figcaption>拟合并检查三个代理：得到可重复计算的系数和各指标MAE。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"筛选可行域：可行与越界候选在二维图上分开。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"117.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">原始候选结果</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"365.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">约束检查</text><path d=\"M460 85 L520 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M514 81L520 85L514 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"520\" y=\"55\" width=\"205\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"622.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">可用结果 / 越界</text></g></svg><figcaption>筛选可行域：可行与越界候选在二维图上分开。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"比较并解释推荐点：得到条件明确的候选方案和基线差异。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">模型输出</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">与基线比较</text><path d=\"M450 85 L510 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M504 81L510 85L504 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"510\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">误差 / 条件 / 复核</text></g></svg><figcaption>比较并解释推荐点：得到条件明确的候选方案和基线差异。</figcaption></figure>"}},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","intro":"同一原油批次，为什么不能只把炉温调高？先读懂分馏与质量约束，再用实际拟合的代理模型寻找可行操作点。","page":"demo/index.html","height":1400}}},"figures":["<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"整理独立工况：每条记录的输入、结果和单位明确。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"55\" width=\"170\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">训练批次</text><path d=\"M185 85 L245 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M239 81L245 85L239 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"245\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"337.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">输入与同批测量</text><path d=\"M430 85 L490 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M484 81L490 85L484 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">留出批次另行评价</text></g></svg><figcaption>整理独立工况：每条记录的输入、结果和单位明确。</figcaption></figure>","<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"拟合并检查三个代理：得到可重复计算的系数和各指标MAE。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"175\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">温度 / 操作 / 原料</text><path d=\"M200 85 L255 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M249 81L255 85L249 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"55\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"355.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">拟合回归系数</text><path d=\"M455 85 L505 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M499 81L505 85L499 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"505\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"615.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">各输出分别预测</text></g></svg><figcaption>拟合并检查三个代理：得到可重复计算的系数和各指标MAE。</figcaption></figure>","<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"筛选可行域：可行与越界候选在二维图上分开。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"117.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">原始候选结果</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"365.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">约束检查</text><path d=\"M460 85 L520 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M514 81L520 85L514 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"520\" y=\"55\" width=\"205\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"622.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">可用结果 / 越界</text></g></svg><figcaption>筛选可行域：可行与越界候选在二维图上分开。</figcaption></figure>","<figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"比较并解释推荐点：得到条件明确的候选方案和基线差异。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"55\" width=\"190\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"115.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">模型输出</text><path d=\"M210 85 L270 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M264 81L270 85L264 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"55\" width=\"180\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">与基线比较</text><path d=\"M450 85 L510 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M504 81L510 85L504 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"510\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"620.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">误差 / 条件 / 复核</text></g></svg><figcaption>比较并解释推荐点：得到条件明确的候选方案和基线差异。</figcaption></figure>"]};
(function(){'use strict';const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),L=globalThis.Lesson;let result=null,status='idle';const scene=L.manifest.sceneId,E=globalThis[scene.toUpperCase()+'Core'];const fmt=(v,n=2)=>Number.isFinite(v)?v.toFixed(n):'—';const params=()=>Object.fromEntries(Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]')).map(x=>[x.id,+x.value]));
function setStatus(s,text){status=s;$('#status').textContent=text;$('#results').dataset.stale=String(s==='stale');$('#export').disabled=s!=='complete';}
function svg(body,aria,h=330){return '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 760 '+h+'" role="img" aria-label="'+aria+'"><g font-family="system-ui,Microsoft YaHei" font-size="14" fill="#29494e">'+body+'</g></svg>';}
function txt(x,y,t,color='#29494e'){return '<text x="'+x+'" y="'+y+'" fill="'+color+'">'+t+'</text>';}
function barComparison(values,baseline,truth){const colors=['#616f86','#638bb2','#2b8980','#c6a666','#9a7980','#765947'];let labels=truth?['测试真值','回归预测','类别均值']:['回归预测','类别均值'],rows=truth?[truth,values,baseline]:[values,baseline],s='';rows.forEach((r,i)=>{let x=115,y=25+i*62;s+=txt(12,y+25,labels[i]);r.forEach((v,j)=>{let w=v*5.9;s+='<rect x="'+x+'" y="'+y+'" width="'+w+'" height="36" fill="'+colors[j]+'"><title>'+result.names[j]+' '+fmt(v)+'%</title></rect>';if(w>34)s+=txt(x+4,y+24,fmt(v,1),'white');x+=w;});});s+=result.names.map((n,j)=>'<rect x="'+(15+j*124)+'" y="'+(rows.length*62+20)+'" width="12" height="12" fill="'+colors[j]+'"/>'+txt(32+j*124,rows.length*62+31,n)).join('');return svg(s,'六项产品组成比较',rows.length*62+65);}
function renderLesson(){$('#background-content').innerHTML=L.manifest.tabs.background.sections.map(s=>'<article class="chapter"><h2>'+s.title+'</h2>'+s.html+'</article>').join('');$('#workflow-content').innerHTML=L.manifest.tabs.workflow.steps.map((s,i)=>'<article class="chapter flow-step"><div class="step-number">步骤 '+(i+1)+'</div><h2>'+s.name+'</h2><p>'+s.do+'</p><p><b>本步得到：</b>'+s.effect+'</p>'+L.figures[i]+'<p class="note">需要留意：'+s.trap+'</p></article>').join('');}
function updateOutputs(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]').forEach(x=>x.nextElementSibling.textContent=x.value);}
function run(){setStatus('running','正在拟合训练批次并计算…');try{result=E.run(params());$('#results').hidden=false;draw();setStatus('complete','计算完成 · '+result.split.train+'批训练 / '+result.split.test+'批独立评价 · '+result.dataNature);}catch(e){setStatus('error','计算失败：'+e.message);}}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('nav [data-tab]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));['background','workflow','lab'].forEach(id=>$('#'+id).hidden=id!==b.dataset.tab);}));document.querySelectorAll('[data-param]').forEach(x=>x.addEventListener('input',()=>{updateOutputs();if(result)setStatus('stale','参数已改变，旧结果待更新 · 请点击重新计算');}));$('#run').addEventListener('click',run);$('#export').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(status!=='complete')return;let a=document.createElement('a'),url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify({caseId:L.manifest.id,status,exportedAt:new Date().toISOString(),...result},null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));a.href=url;a.download=scene+'-result.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);});globalThis.CaseInspect={snapshot:()=>({sceneId:scene,status,params:params(),result})};renderLesson();updateOutputs();
function draw(){let r=result,g=r.grid,s='';for(let p of g){let x=80+(p.x.temperature-350)*20,y=260-(p.x.reflux-1.4)/1.2*210,v=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(p.y[0]-55)/18));s+='<rect x="'+(x-9)+'" y="'+(y-3.2)+'" width="18" height="6.4" fill="'+(p.feasible?'hsl(164 40% '+(85-v*55)+'%)':'#dce2df')+'"><title>'+p.x.temperature+'°C / 回流比'+fmt(p.x.reflux)+'：收率'+fmt(p.y[0])+'%，能耗'+fmt(p.y[1])+' GJ/t，终馏点'+fmt(p.y[2])+'°C；'+(p.feasible?'可行':'越界')+'</title></rect>';}
for(let t=350;t<=380;t+=5)s+=txt(65+(t-350)*20,292,t);for(let q=1.4;q<=2.601;q+=.3)s+=txt(20,265-(q-1.4)/1.2*210,fmt(q,1));s+=txt(300,324,'炉出口温度 / °C')+txt(12,25,'回流比');if(r.chosen){let x=80+(r.chosen.x.temperature-350)*20,y=260-(r.chosen.x.reflux-1.4)/1.2*210;s+='<rect x="'+(x-11)+'" y="'+(y-7)+'" width="22" height="14" fill="none" stroke="#be6b30" stroke-width="3"/>';}
$('#grid-chart').innerHTML=svg(s,'温度—回流比约束可行域');$('#summary').innerHTML='<div class="split"><div class="metric">可行候选<b>'+r.feasibleCount+' / '+r.grid.length+'</b></div><div class="metric">推荐点相对固定点收率变化<b>'+(r.chosen?fmt(r.improvement)+' 个百分点':'无可行解')+'</b></div></div><p class="help">'+(r.chosen?'推荐来自满足两项上限的候选；固定操作点'+(r.baseline.feasible?'也在可行域内。':'当前越界，因此收益差不能被视为两个可执行方案的直接比较。'):'当前压力与约束下没有可行候选。调整能耗或终馏点上限后重新计算，保留这个空解结论。')+'</p>';
let points=[['固定操作点',r.baseline],['推荐候选',r.chosen]];$('#comparison').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>方案</th><th>炉温°C</th><th>回流比</th><th>回收率%</th><th>能耗GJ/t</th><th>终馏点°C</th><th>约束</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+points.map(([name,c])=>'<tr><th>'+name+'</th>'+(c?'<td>'+fmt(c.x.temperature,0)+'</td><td>'+fmt(c.x.reflux)+'</td>'+c.y.map(v=>'<td>'+fmt(v)+'</td>').join('')+'<td>'+(c.feasible?'满足':'越界')+'</td>':'<td colspan="6">无可行解</td>')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';
$('#validation').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>指标（单位）</th><th>回归MAE</th><th>训练均值MAE</th><th>测试批次</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+r.metrics.map((m,i)=>'<tr><th>'+m.name+'（'+['百分点','GJ/t','°C'][i]+'）</th><td>'+fmt(m.mae,3)+'</td><td>'+fmt(r.baselineMetrics[i].mae,3)+'</td><td>'+m.n+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table><p>下图每点是一条测试工况。横轴测量回收率，纵轴回归预测回收率；越靠近斜线越准确。</p>';
let sc=v=>70+(v-50)*21,sy=v=>270-(v-50)*9;s='<path d="M70 20V270H700" fill="none" stroke="#9aafaa"/><path d="M70 270L700 0" stroke="#bd9772" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/>';r.test.forEach(t=>s+='<circle cx="'+sc(t.truth[0])+'" cy="'+sy(t.prediction[0])+'" r="4" fill="#287a70" opacity=".7"><title>'+t.id+'：测量'+fmt(t.truth[0])+'，预测'+fmt(t.prediction[0])+'</title></circle>');for(let v=50;v<=80;v+=5)s+=txt(sc(v)-7,292,v);s+=txt(300,323,'测量回收率 / %')+txt(75,18,'预测回收率 / %');$('#test-chart').innerHTML=svg(s,'独立测试工况回收率观测与预测');}
})();
(function(g){'use strict';
function mount(root=document){root.querySelectorAll('.case-flow-overview').forEach(chart=>{
 if(chart.dataset.flowMounted)return;chart.dataset.flowMounted='true';
 const area=chart.closest('#workflow')||chart.closest('main')||root;
 const targets=()=>[...area.querySelectorAll('[data-sr-step],[data-step]')].filter(e=>!e.closest('.case-flow-overview'));
 const chapters=()=>area.querySelectorAll('#workflow-content>article,.flow-step,.workflow-step');
 const select=n=>{chart.querySelectorAll('[data-flow-step]').forEach(el=>el.setAttribute('aria-current',String(+el.dataset.flowStep===n)));};
 const go=el=>{const n=+el.dataset.flowStep,b=targets().find(b=>+(b.dataset.srStep??b.dataset.step)===n);if(b)b.click();else chapters()[n]?.scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'auto'});select(n);};
 chart.querySelectorAll('[data-flow-step]').forEach(el=>{el.setAttribute('role','button');el.setAttribute('tabindex','0');el.setAttribute('aria-label','查看步骤 '+(+el.dataset.flowStep+1)+'：'+el.textContent.trim());});
 chart.querySelector('[data-flow-instruction]').textContent=' 点击图中节点，可查看对应步骤。';
 chart.addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('[data-flow-step]');if(el)go(el);});
 chart.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' ')&&e.target.matches('[data-flow-step]')){e.preventDefault();go(e.target);}});
 area.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-sr-step],[data-step]');if(b)select(+(b.dataset.srStep??b.dataset.step));});
 const current=targets().find(b=>b.matches('[aria-selected=true],[aria-pressed=true],.active'));select(+(current?.dataset.srStep??current?.dataset.step??0));
 });}
g.S17Flow={mount};
})(globalThis);

